                        "sense_id": "c5fc7806-8cfa-3387-9cf7-99cd806edaec",
                        "entry_id": "71d0bf4c-1d54-3431-a060-5543031856ef",
                        "glosses": [
                            "qui se pilote tout seul, qui est autopiloté"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ddf51146-357d-414c-abf5-9dc485d47c98",
                                "sense_id": "c5fc7806-8cfa-3387-9cf7-99cd806edaec",
                                "text": "Jusqu’à présent Google avait testé son dispositif de voiture autopilotée sur des modèles existants."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e42272ac-173d-4520-a37e-9681d0f59315",
                        "source_entry_id": "71d0bf4c-1d54-3431-a060-5543031856ef",
                        "source_sense_id": "c5fc7806-8cfa-3387-9cf7-99cd806edaec",
                        "target_lang_word": "driverless",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "driverless",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e23a2221-470f-3213-888d-db0cba9b7347",
                                        "entry_id": "5f32c810-2c9c-378e-a73c-cbe180c98c71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without a driver."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4aa9b72d-6da8-465a-97e4-2f5a3862fc33",
                                                "sense_id": "e23a2221-470f-3213-888d-db0cba9b7347",
                                                "text": "a driverless vehicle"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cefe944f-dbf3-4e02-978d-8f211b6440de",
                                                "sense_id": "e23a2221-470f-3213-888d-db0cba9b7347",
                                                "text": "Will Underground trains be completely driverless? The new signalling being installed as part of the Upgrade will allow this, and the development, allowing a faster throughput of trains, might arise from, or be stopped by, a battle with the unions. Mike Brown, Managing Director of London Underground, envisages driverless trains within twenty years."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdde94da-2064-4b2e-910d-bd7138ac53d8",
                                                "sense_id": "e23a2221-470f-3213-888d-db0cba9b7347",
                                                "text": "One of the latest [conditions], from last summer, was that Transport for London should look again at driverless trains. I examined their prospects in RAIL 933, and it's fair to say that their introduction is technically difficult and very expensive. If introducing driverless Tube trains were easy, then I'm quite sure that Prime Minister Boris Johnson would have brought them into service during his two terms as London mayor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1133bf39-96eb-432a-ae5c-3180f9ad24d7",
                                                "sense_id": "e23a2221-470f-3213-888d-db0cba9b7347",
                                                "text": "Toyota Motor Corp. will begin a self-driving transportation service in Odaiba, Tokyo, this summer using the technology of Level 4 autonomous driving — automated driving under certain conditions — with the aim of starting a driverless robotaxi business in the future, sources said."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5e176f0-0a26-4de6-b276-2bbc6159f5e4",
                                                "sense_id": "e23a2221-470f-3213-888d-db0cba9b7347",
                                                "text": "A man who blocked and shouted at a driverless Waymo car later brutally beat a bystander who told him to let it go, California police reported."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a1c208d-1ef0-4fc9-af83-021fff671331",
                                                "sense_id": "e23a2221-470f-3213-888d-db0cba9b7347",
                                                "text": "The regulations apply to self-driving cars, which have a human behind the wheel. These differ from the driverless cars that Elon Musk’s Tesla and other companies are also working on, which are not allowed on UK roads. , Joe Pinkstone, 9"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3f0ceded-ed4f-4188-a356-be0dc17da88e",
                        "source_entry_id": "71d0bf4c-1d54-3431-a060-5543031856ef",
                        "source_sense_id": "c5fc7806-8cfa-3387-9cf7-99cd806edaec",
                        "target_lang_word": "self-driving",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "self-driving",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5714bc68-3412-3d71-92fa-58bbf6087c98",
                                        "entry_id": "e9d549c9-d636-352f-8061-2d0b9e1a7572",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a motor vehicle: equipped with sensors and computer technology to allow it to drive without a human operator."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "049fb8e0-f068-43cc-993d-ce694e44a254",
                                                "sense_id": "5714bc68-3412-3d71-92fa-58bbf6087c98",
                                                "text": "Computer vision is used in image recognition systems and also in self-driving technologies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "966215eb-d440-4024-a484-a18a93d0c132",
                                                "sense_id": "5714bc68-3412-3d71-92fa-58bbf6087c98",
                                                "text": "Mercedes-Benz has received approval for a self-driving system paving the way for it to be able to offer the technology to customers where national legislation allows its use."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d148424-bf75-41c3-9b17-067ba11d01e5",
                                                "sense_id": "5714bc68-3412-3d71-92fa-58bbf6087c98",
                                                "text": "By self-driving vehicles, we mean those listed as automated vehicles by the Secretary of State for Transport under the Automated and Electric Vehicles Act 2018. (...) These vehicles are capable of safely driving themselves when the self-driving function is correctly turned on and the driver follows the manufacturer’s instructions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f12b583d-e59f-4044-b891-7b5eee9a5742",
                                                "sense_id": "5714bc68-3412-3d71-92fa-58bbf6087c98",
                                                "text": "Toyota Motor Corp. will begin a self-driving transportation service in Odaiba, Tokyo, this summer using the technology of Level 4 autonomous driving — automated driving under certain conditions — with the aim of starting a driverless robotaxi business in the future, sources said."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "self-driving",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71caa727-7d95-3c3f-80d7-1744d8e80a6b",
                                        "entry_id": "b73ec8e1-9763-37a1-b08e-270cedcec566",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The ability of a motor vehicle to drive itself without a human operator; the technology that enables this."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c420e29-0695-4cca-83b9-9ba3d590db91",
                                                "sense_id": "71caa727-7d95-3c3f-80d7-1744d8e80a6b",
                                                "text": "Self-driving will re-arrange the economic landscape of the world, like the invention of the automobile did."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da29421d-d89b-4c83-aa8f-fdb3d645710f",
                                                "sense_id": "71caa727-7d95-3c3f-80d7-1744d8e80a6b",
                                                "text": "China’s approach to self-driving reflects its attitude to development more broadly: heavy on infrastructure and government oversight, lighter on cutting-edge technology and civil liberties."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2bc9b61a-7a0b-4d08-ad4a-c59c788a47dd",
                                                "sense_id": "71caa727-7d95-3c3f-80d7-1744d8e80a6b",
                                                "text": "Billed as the first everyday consumer application of AI, self-driving has simultaneously inspired its champions and proved a worry for its investors."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
